#: information.py:411
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"There is **{number}** person in {user}'s family tree, including all blood "
"and non-blood relatives."
msgid_plural ""
"There are **{number}** people in {user}'s family tree, including all blood "
"and non-blood relatives."
msgstr[0] ""
"L'arbre généalogique de {user} compte **{number}** personnes, en incluant "
"tous les parents, qu'ils soient de sang ou non."
msgstr[1] ""
"L'arbre généalogique de {user} compte **{number}** personnes, y compris tous "
"les parents de sang et les parents par alliance."

#. TRANSLATORS: Command name (/tree)
#: information.py:419
