#. TRANSLATORS: Command name
#: misc.py:32
msgid "info"
msgstr "info"

#. TRANSLATORS: Command description
#: misc.py:34
msgid "Give you information about the bot."
msgstr "Te donner des informations sur le bot."

#: misc.py:44
msgid ""
"MarriageBot is a bot that allows users to marry, divorce, and have children "
"with other users. It also features a unique family tree system that allows "
"users to view their family history and relationships.\n"
"-# MarriageBot is being maintained by [Voxel Fox](https://voxelfox.co.uk)."
msgstr ""
"MarriageBot est un bot qui permet aux utilisateurs de se marier, de divorcer "
"et d'avoir des enfants avec d'autres utilisateurs. Il propose également un "
"système unique d'arbre généalogique qui permet aux utilisateurs de consulter "
"leur histoire familiale et leurs liens de parenté.\n"
"-# MarriageBot est géré par [Voxel Fox](https://voxelfox.co.uk)."

#: misc.py:52
msgid "Family Tree Members"
msgstr "Membres de l'arbre généalogique"

#: misc.py:62 misc.py:176
msgid "Donate"
msgstr "Faire un don"

#: misc.py:67
msgid "Support Server"
msgstr "Serveur d'assistance"

#. TRANSLATORS: Command name
#: misc.py:81
msgid "perks"
msgstr "avantages"

#. TRANSLATORS: Command description
#: misc.py:83
msgid "Give you information about the bot's premium perks."
msgstr "Te donner des infos sur les avantages premium du bot."

#. TRANSLATORS: Command name
#: misc.py:94
msgid "donate"
msgstr "faire un don"

#. TRANSLATORS: Command description
#: misc.py:96
msgid "Give you information about the bot's donation options."
msgstr ""
"Te donner des informations sur les options de don proposées par le bot."

#: misc.py:112
msgid "Support MarriageBot"
msgstr "Soutiens MarriageBot"

#: misc.py:114
msgid ""
"If you enjoy MarriageBot, please consider donating to support its ongoing "
"maintainance, development, and hosting costs.\n"
"MarriageBot isn't a small bot by any means, and keeping it going requires a "
"lot of time and resources behind the scenes."
msgstr ""
"Si tu apprécies MarriageBot, pense à faire un don pour contribuer à couvrir "
"les frais de maintenance, de développement et d'hébergement.\n"
"MarriageBot est loin d'être un petit bot, et son fonctionnement nécessite "
"beaucoup de temps et de ressources en coulisses."

#: misc.py:120
msgid "Donation Perks"
msgstr "Avantages liés aux dons"

#: misc.py:122
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"By supporting MarriageBot, you gain access to exclusive perks depending on "
"your subscription level:\n"
"* Default\n"
"  * 5 children\n"
"  * 1 partner\n"
"* T1\n"
"  * 10 children\n"
"  * 2 partners\n"
"  * Access to {disownall_c}\n"
"* T2\n"
"  * 15 children\n"
"  * 4 partners\n"
"  * Access to {disownall_c}\n"
"  * Access to {fulltree_c}\n"
"* T3\n"
"  * 20 children\n"
"  * 8 partners\n"
"  * Access to {disownall_c}\n"
"  * Access to {fulltree_c}\n"
"In addition, you can buy MarriageBot Gold for your server, which lets your "
"server have its own family tree, and gives you access to the force "
"commands!\n"
"* Default\n"
"  * Global tree\n"
"* Gold\n"
"  * Server-specific tree\n"
"  * Access to the force commands ({forcedivorce_c}, {forcemarry_c}, "
"{forceadopt_c}, {forcerunaway_c})\n"
"  * Access to {incest_c}\n"
"  * T3 perks for all of your server members\n"
msgstr ""
"En soutenant MarriageBot, tu bénéficies d'avantages exclusifs en fonction de "
"ton niveau d'abonnement :\n"
"* Par défaut\n"
"  * 5 enfants\n"
"  * 1 partenaire\n"
"* T1\n"
"  * 10 enfants\n"
"  * 2 partenaires\n"
"  * Accès à {disownall_c}\n"
"* T2\n"
"  * 15 enfants\n"
"  * 4 partenaires\n"
"  * Accès à {disownall_c}\n"
"  * Accès à {fulltree_c}\n"
"* T3\n"
"  * 20 enfants\n"
"  * 8 partenaires\n"
"  * Accès à {disownall_c}\n"
"  * Accès à {fulltree_c}\n"
"De plus, tu peux acheter MarriageBot Gold pour ton serveur, ce qui permet à "
"ton serveur d'avoir son propre arbre généalogique et te donne accès aux "
"commandes de force !\n"
"* Par défaut\n"
"  * Arbre global\n"
"* Gold\n"
"  * Arbre spécifique au serveur\n"
"  * Accès aux commandes de force ({forcedivorce_c}, {forcemarry_c}, "
"{forceadopt_c}, {forcerunaway_c})\n"
"  * Accès à {incest_c}\n"
"  * Avantages T3 pour tous les membres de ton serveur\n"

#: misc.py:162
msgid "How to Support"
msgstr "Comment nous soutenir"

#: misc.py:164
msgid ""
"Subscriptions can be taken out on the [Voxel Fox website](https://voxelfox."
"co.uk/portal/marriagebot) :3"
msgstr ""
"Tu peux t'abonner sur le [site web de Voxel Fox](https://voxelfox.co.uk/"
